          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "content": "<p>1. Charge fully (about 2 hours). 2. Put the cap on a clean, dry scalp. 3. Press the button to turn it on and choose a mode (Normal, Breathing, 10Hz or 40Hz) and one of 3 brightness levels. 4. Relax for 30 minutes; the cap beeps when time's up. 5. Use once a day. Consistency matters most.</p>"
          }
        },
